# UMTUBA regression lock

Read and follow `docs/ai/UMTUBA_AGENT_REGRESSION_POLICY.md`.

- No product edit without `docs/ai/tasks/CURRENT_TASK_MANIFEST.json`.
- Run `npm run regression:task-check`, `regression:scope-check`, and `regression:contracts` before claiming work complete.
- Unit PASS is never OWNER_PASS. Current Fold6 Watch is DEVICE_FAIL.
- No EAS before `npm run regression:pre-eas`. Default one EAS build per task.
- Do not change Watch while implementing an unrelated feature.
- Latest commit is not automatically the baseline. Compare against accepted baseline SHA.
